{
  "bookId": "hero-212014",
  "id": "bond-29328",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29328001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "如果斩断了自己的退路，那我将——战无不胜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "变，身！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃，发生什么事了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔哇哇哇！主、主人你怎么在这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "其实刚才就在了……不好意思打扰你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜……太让人害羞了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，姿势很帅气哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看得出来，真乃很喜欢那部关于英雄的动画吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯，从小就很喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "每次父亲训完我后……我就会躲在房间里看那部动画的录像。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "父亲很可怕吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "听到这里，真乃摇了摇头，露出了怀念的表情。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "还好吧，虽然父亲总是凶巴巴的样子，但我其实……并不讨厌他。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……从记事起，母亲的身体就很不好，一直是父亲在照顾母亲和我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "所以我也想快点成长起来，如果自己能够独当一面就好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这样啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "就像漫画里的英雄们那样，一路和反派对抗，保护自己的家人和朋友。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哪怕孤身作战，身上背负着他人的误解，也要守护和平的生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你想要成为大家的「英雄」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯，主人应该会觉得我很幼稚吧……啊哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "并不幼稚哦。这是非常美好的理想。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……谢谢。我会继续努力下去，直到成为值得自豪的「英雄」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "等到那一天，主人会在身边为我喝彩吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29328024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然了，我向你承诺。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
